<title>FINLAND: SILJA FEB PASSENGER VOLUME UP 1 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>SILJA FEB PASSENGER VOLUME UP 1 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry</p>
<p>operator Silja Oy Ab said in a statement on Friday the number of</p>
<p>passengers carried in February by its Baltic Sea operator Silja</p>
<p>Line rose one percent year-on-year to 454,056.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p> Passenger volume (1,000)	    Feb 1997	change yr/yr</p>
<p> Helsinki-Stockholm		    114,551	   +13 pct</p>
<p> Turku-Stockholm			 173,724	    -1 pct</p>
<p> Vaasa traffic			    41,988	   +15 pct</p>
<p> Helsinki-Tallinn			108,319	   -12 pct</p>
<p> Finnjet				    15,474	    -3 pct</p>
<p> TOTAL passengers			454,056	    +1 pct</p>
<p> Cars					 20,092	    -8 pct</p>
<p> Freight units			    11,277	    +5 pct</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
